    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I have this huge presentation coming up at work tomorrow and I'm freaking out. My hands won't stop shaking and my heart is racing so fast it's making me dizzy. I have some propranolol left over from a while ago, would it be okay to take one of those to help me calm down for the meeting? I do have asthma but it's usually fine.",
